---
const currentYear = 2026;
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 pb-12">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-slate-800">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-700 to-brand-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
            PetCare<span class="text-brand-400">HN</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Sistema integral de gestión veterinaria y cuidado de mascotas para Honduras. Conectando a propietarios y clínicas veterinarias en una sola plataforma moderna y confiable.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Cumplimiento verificado con directrices de Google Play Store</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Navegación</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Inicio</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#caracteristicas" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Características Principales</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#roles" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Dueños vs. Veterinarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#descarga" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Google Play Store</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Cumplimiento Legal</h4>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 border border-brand-500/30">Google Play</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/privacidad"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-300 hover:text-brand-200 transition-colors font-medium"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Política de Privacidad</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/eliminar-cuenta"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 transition-colors font-medium"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Eliminación de Cuenta y Datos</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/terminos"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Términos y Condiciones de Uso</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            Canal de contacto: <a href="mailto:soporte@petcarehn.com" class="text-white hover:underline font-semibold">soporte@petcarehn.com</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <div>
        <p>© {currentYear} PetCare HN. Desarrollado por el <strong>Equipo Grupo 5 - Programación Móvil 1</strong>.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">San Pedro Sula, Honduras. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
